---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="工具" description="放在角落里的两个小工具：SEM 粒径分析和资讯简报。">
  <section class="stage tools-stage">
    <div class="blobs" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="blob blob-a"></span>
      <span class="blob blob-b"></span>
      <span class="blob blob-c"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="stage-content">
      <div class="tools-head rise">
        <h1>工具</h1>
        <p>放在角落里的两个小东西。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-grid">
        <article class="glass tool-card rise d1">
          <div class="tool-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7">
              <circle cx="9" cy="12" r="4.2" />
              <circle cx="15.2" cy="12" r="4.2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2>SEM 粒径分析</h2>
          <p>用阈值、形态学和分水岭量晶粒，图片只留在这台电脑上。</p>
          <p class="tool-links">
            <a href="/tools/particle/">打开</a>
            <a href="/blog/sem-ai-tool/">相关笔记</a>
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="glass tool-card rise d2">
          <div class="tool-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round">
              <path d="M5 7h14M5 12h14M5 17h9" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2>资讯简报</h2>
          <p>把公开的投资、科研、web3 和科技来源收成一页，给自己看。</p>
          <p class="tool-links">
            <a href="/tools/digest/">打开</a>
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
